<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= try_item i s =\n    := ^ body \\* a {number} b. (i : a) : stream b -> option b = \\|\n        | StreamCons (x, _) ?& i <= 0 => Some x\n        | StreamCons (_, fn) => 루프 (i - 1) (fn ())\n        | StreamNil => None\n    :& := 루프 \\* a {number} b. (acc : a) (s' : stream b) : option b =\n        ?= var_is acc, var_is s' ?|\n        | !-, !- => body acc s'\n        | _ =>\n            := acc = dyn acc\n            := s' = dyn s'\n            ~~ body acc s'\n    루프 i s\n\n:= item i =\n    try_item i >> optionm::value","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := try_item i s =
      := ^ body \* a {number} b. (i : a) : stream b -> option b = \|
          | StreamCons (x, _) ?& i <= 0 => Some x
          | StreamCons (_, fn) => 루프 (i - 1) (fn ())
          | StreamNil => None
      :& := 루프 \* a {number} b. (acc : a) (s' : stream b) : option b =
          ?= var_is acc, var_is s' ?|
          | !-, !- => body acc s'
          | _ =>
              := acc = dyn acc
              := s' = dyn s'
              ~~ body acc s'
      루프 i s

  := item i =
      try_item i >> optionm::value
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

