<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= new_finite_stream fn max =\n    := ^ 루프 n =\n        ? n >= max\n        ?> StreamNil\n        |: StreamCons (fn n, \\ () => 루프 (n + 1))\n    루프 0\n\n:| memoized_stream t =\n    | NotComputed : () -> stream t\n    | Computed : stream t\n\n:= memoize s =\n    := ^ body \\* t. (s : () -> stream t) : () -> stream t =\n        := state = mut (NotComputed s)\n        \\ () =>\n            ?= *state ?|\n            | Computed x => x\n            | NotComputed fn =>\n                := new_state =\n                    ?= fn () ?|\n                    | StreamNil => StreamNil\n                    | StreamCons (x, fn) => StreamCons (x, 루프 fn)\n                state <- Computed new_state\n                new_state\n    :& := 루프 \\* t. (s' : () -> stream t) : () -> stream t =\n        join_body_unit body s s'\n    루프 \\ () => s","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := new_finite_stream fn max =
      := ^ 루프 n =
          ? n >= max
          ?> StreamNil
          |: StreamCons (fn n, \ () => 루프 (n + 1))
      루프 0

  :| memoized_stream t =
      | NotComputed : () -> stream t
      | Computed : stream t

  := memoize s =
      := ^ body \* t. (s : () -> stream t) : () -> stream t =
          := state = mut (NotComputed s)
          \ () =>
              ?= *state ?|
              | Computed x => x
              | NotComputed fn =>
                  := new_state =
                      ?= fn () ?|
                      | StreamNil => StreamNil
                      | StreamCons (x, fn) => StreamCons (x, 루프 fn)
                  state <- Computed new_state
                  new_state
      :& := 루프 \* t. (s' : () -> stream t) : () -> stream t =
          join_body_unit body s s'
      루프 \ () => s
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

