<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= unfold f x0 =\n    := ^ body x =\n        ?= f x ?|\n        | Some (x', y) => StreamCons (x', \\ () => 루프 y)\n        | None => StreamNil\n    :& := 루프 x = join_body_unit body x0 x\n    루프 x0\n\n:= iterate f =\n    \\ x => Some (x, f x)\n    |> unfold","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := unfold f x0 =
      := ^ body x =
          ?= f x ?|
          | Some (x', y) => StreamCons (x', \ () => 루프 y)
          | None => StreamNil
      :& := 루프 x = join_body_unit body x0 x
      루프 x0

  := iterate f =
      \ x => Some (x, f x)
      |> unfold
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

