<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= zip_with fn s1 s2 =\n    := ^ 루프 s1 s2 =\n        ?= s1, s2 ?|\n        | StreamCons (st1, fn1), StreamCons (st2, fn2) =>\n            StreamCons (fn st1 st2, \\ () => 루프 (fn1 ()) (fn2 ()))\n        | StreamNil, _ | _, StreamNil => StreamNil\n    루프 s1 s2\n\n:= zip_with_ fn s1 s2 =\n    :~ ^ 루프 s1 s2 =\n        ?= s1, s2 ?|\n        | StreamCons (st1, fn1), StreamCons (st2, fn2) =>\n            StreamCons (fn st1 st2, \\ () => 루프 (fn1 ()) (fn2 ()))\n        | StreamNil, _ | _, StreamNil => StreamNil\n    루프 s1 s2","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := zip_with fn s1 s2 =
      := ^ 루프 s1 s2 =
          ?= s1, s2 ?|
          | StreamCons (st1, fn1), StreamCons (st2, fn2) =>
              StreamCons (fn st1 st2, \ () => 루프 (fn1 ()) (fn2 ()))
          | StreamNil, _ | _, StreamNil => StreamNil
      루프 s1 s2

  := zip_with_ fn s1 s2 =
      :~ ^ 루프 s1 s2 =
          ?= s1, s2 ?|
          | StreamCons (st1, fn1), StreamCons (st2, fn2) =>
              StreamCons (fn st1 st2, \ () => 루프 (fn1 ()) (fn2 ()))
          | StreamNil, _ | _, StreamNil => StreamNil
      루프 s1 s2
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

