<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= unzip s =\n    := ^ body \\* a b. (s : stream (a * b)) : stream a * stream b =\n        ?= s ?|\n        | StreamCons ((x, y), fn) =>\n            := xs, ys = 루프 (fn ())\n            StreamCons (x, \\ () => xs), StreamCons (y, \\ () => ys)\n        | StreamNil => pair StreamNil StreamNil\n    :& := 루프 \\* a b. (x : stream (a * b)) : stream a * stream b =\n        ? var_is x |> not\n        ?> body x\n        |:\n            := x = dyn x\n            ~~ body x\n    루프 s","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := unzip s =
      := ^ body \* a b. (s : stream (a * b)) : stream a * stream b =
          ?= s ?|
          | StreamCons ((x, y), fn) =>
              := xs, ys = 루프 (fn ())
              StreamCons (x, \ () => xs), StreamCons (y, \ () => ys)
          | StreamNil => pair StreamNil StreamNil
      :& := 루프 \* a b. (x : stream (a * b)) : stream a * stream b =
          ? var_is x |> not
          ?> body x
          |:
              := x = dyn x
              ~~ body x
      루프 s
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

