<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n\nlistm::init 10i32 id\n|> listm::map \\ x => x, x\n|> from_list\n|> unzip\n|> \\ x, y =>\n    x |> sum\n    |> _assert_eq 45\n\n    y |> sum\n    |> _assert_eq 45","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol

  listm::init 10i32 id
  |> listm::map \ x => x, x
  |> from_list
  |> unzip
  |> \ x, y =>
      x |> sum
      |> _assert_eq 45

      y |> sum
      |> _assert_eq 45
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

